Note on official builds — this license covers the source code in this
repository. The signed and notarized desktop builds sold at
https://card-news-zeta.vercel.app are distributed under their own terms
(https://card-news-zeta.vercel.app/terms): they include a free period and
require a license key. Building from source yourself needs no key and never
will.

